crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_authorized_recovery_route:metadata_command_recovery_invocation_constructor
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_local_recovery_route:metadata_command_authorized_drain_primitive
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_local_recovery_route:metadata_command_recovery_authority_constructor
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_local_recovery_route:metadata_command_recovery_invocation_constructor
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_recovery_authority:metadata_command_authorized_drain_primitive
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_metadata_command_with_recovery_authority:metadata_command_recovery_invocation_constructor
crates/storage/src/cluster/payload_operations.rs:drain_pending_object_metadata_command_with_work_budget:metadata_command_authorized_drain_primitive
